# Waffl Grid Imports

Always import `Grid` as a default import from `@waffl`. Never use deep paths or named imports.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
import { Grid } from '@waffl';
import Grid from '@/theme/tackl/waffl';
import Grid from '@theme/tackl/waffl';
import { Grid } from '@/theme/tackl/waffl';

// ✅ GOOD
import Grid from '@waffl';
```

When editing existing files, replace any other `Grid` import with `import Grid from '@waffl';`.
